00:08:35.652 --> 00:08:37.109
- I'm thrilled to be like, business.

00:08:37.109 --> 00:08:39.149
But when giving,

00:08:39.149 --> 00:08:40.687
giving is giving.

00:08:40.687 --> 00:08:42.365
You don't need the accolades.

00:08:42.365 --> 00:08:44.448
And people blend the two.

00:08:45.637 --> 00:08:48.804
