00:09:06.032 --> 00:09:07.099
I'll make it important to me.

00:09:07.099 --> 00:09:08.483
- Thank you.

00:09:08.483 --> 00:09:09.393
- Vlog,

00:09:09.393 --> 00:09:11.269
Krupa, the best!

00:09:11.269 --> 00:09:12.871
(bell ding)
If you need a PR company,

00:09:12.871 --> 00:09:13.845
this is your lady.

00:09:13.845 --> 00:09:15.509
Link it up, give her love.

00:09:15.509 --> 00:09:17.028
She's the best!

00:09:17.028 --> 00:09:18.932
But it's execution, not idea.

00:09:18.932 --> 00:09:20.476
- Everything you do,

00:09:20.476 --> 00:09:22.044
it means a lot, dude!

00:09:22.044 --> 00:09:22.916
- I appreciate that.

00:09:22.916 --> 00:09:24.629
- You really changed my life,

00:09:24.629 --> 00:09:25.462
for real though.

00:09:25.462 --> 00:09:26.636
I know you hear it all the time,

00:09:26.636 --> 00:09:27.469
but like,

00:09:27.469 --> 00:09:29.764
the main thing you talk
about that I really fuck with

00:09:29.764 --> 00:09:31.140
100 percent is self-awareness.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:32.815
The realest shit ever.

00:09:32.815 --> 00:09:34.315
Realest shit ever.

00:09:38.381 --> 00:09:41.881
