00:11:00.314 --> 00:11:01.754
It's true, D-Rock!

00:11:01.754 --> 00:11:03.657
Doing the right thing is
always the right thing.

00:11:03.657 --> 00:11:04.788
Always and forever.

00:11:04.788 --> 00:11:06.298
Life.

00:11:06.298 --> 00:11:08.089
Super fuckin' interesting.

